config FINGERPRINT_FPC_1540
	tristate "FPC 1540 fingerprint sensor platform driver"
	depends on INPUT_FINGERPRINT
	help
	  Platform driver for the FPC 1540 side-mounted fingerprint sensor
	  used on the Xiaomi marble (POCO F5 / Redmi Note 12 Turbo).

	  It controls the sensor supply, reset line and IRQ and exposes the
	  downstream sysfs ABI used by the FPC vendor HAL.  Fingerprint
	  matching itself is performed by the vendor TEE application.

	  To compile this driver as a module, choose M here.  The module will
	  be called fpc1540.
